 forgotten secrets</i></strong></h2> - Memory fragments are scattered across the blueprint. Retrace the path of the Prime Mover to uncover the story of the Byte of Burden!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693700/extras/f8f312027c47b7003435917c6b8a3a3c.poster.avif?t=1572339742\" width=626 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693700/extras/f8f312027c47b7003435917c6b8a3a3c.webm?t=1572339742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
